"masks the URL of the JavaScript file. "

#: inc/addons/class-popup-addon-headerfooter.php:269
msgid ""
"Kritisch: Aufruf von <code>wp_head();</code> fehlt! Es sollte direkt vor "
"<code>&lt;/head&gt;</code> erscheinen"
msgstr ""
"Critical: The call to <code>wp_head();</code> is missing! It should appear immediately before "
"<code>&lt;/head&gt;</code>"

#: inc/addons/class-popup-addon-headerfooter.php:285
